    <string name="rule_action_silence">silence it</string>
    <string name="rule_silence_hint">Android starts the sound the moment a notification arrives, before any app can step in, so a short tone may still get through. ReNotify cuts it off, drops the banner and keeps the notification quietly in your status bar.</string>
    <string name="telemetry_card_title">Help make ReNotify better?</string>
    <string name="telemetry_card_body">Once a day ReNotify can send a short report to our own server: a random ID, app and Android version, language, how many notifications are stored, and crash reports. Never what your notifications say. Nothing is sent unless you agree, and you can change it in Settings at any time.</string>
